WEBVTT

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:04.370
What was it...

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:05.940
...you needed to discuss?

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.320
Okay. You see,

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.800
there has been an increase in our ranks,

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.450
thus making Yagi’s estate somewhat
cramped for all of us.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.390
You have empty rooms here
and it is quite spacious.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.520
As such, I was hoping you would
be willing to swap rooms.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.460
Niimi’s room is now vacant as well.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.090
Was this your idea?

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.590
No, Toshi and Sannan-kun suggested it.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.700
In that case, I could hardly refuse.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:44.850
If I were to refuse, they are bound
to lay the blame on you.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.110
I greatly appreciate it.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.580
Cur, is the saké ready yet?!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.280
I’m on my way!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.500
Are you okay?!

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.570
Shut up!

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:19.510
Serizawa-san, you’re actually
really sick, aren’t you?

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.510
What did you say?

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:25.580
You’re going to die if
you keep pushing yourself!

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:27.770
You should talk to
Kondou-san and the guys

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.150
and work to get better.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.470
Silence!

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:34.880
Another word out of you on that topic...

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:36.900
...and I will pull out your tongue!

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.240
I don’t get it!

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.400
Why do you insist
on pushing yourself so hard?!

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.160
Do you WANT to die?

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:47.390
There is no way you could
understand as you are now.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:51.420
The issue has nothing to
do with living or dying.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.040
Huh?

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:34.480
September 15, 1863

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.710
We’ll carry it out tomorrow.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.840
Kondou-san, is that acceptable?

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.260
We have received orders
from the Aizu Domain.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.210
I will take full
responsibility for this.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:51.250
Guys, I’m counting on you!

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.250
In order for us to move on,

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.120
this is a path we simply
cannot skirt around.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:03.260
The Great Dawn

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.260
September 16, 1863

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.390
I’m going out.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:11.860
Come accompany me!

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.640
Huh? Where are we going?

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.390
Shimabara.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:18.900
Hijikata and the others said
they would show me a good time.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.280
Hmm, is that right?

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.870
Hurry it up!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.280
A dog should not make its master wait!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.780
Oh... Hey, wait!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.470
Today we’re having a party!

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.910
Drink as much as you like!

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.840
Yay! This is sweet!
Nice! Let’s drink to our heart’s content!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:38.540
All of you are acting
unusually generous today.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:39.460
Heisuke, let’s having
a drinking contest.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.420
What brought about this change of heart?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.480
Oh, bring it on!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.420
Start!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.760
It ain’t right for
the chief and commander

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.930
to constantly be at each
other’s throats, now is it?

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.310
Very well.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:57.970
If that is the case,
I will drink heartily!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:03.410
I wish Sano and Gen-san
coulda joined us!

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:06.790
Drinking saké with everyone like
this is the best, isn’t it?

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:09.830
Sure is! Right, Ryunosuke?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.660
Yeah, although I can’t drink.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.250
C’mon! Let’s have
a blast, Serizawa-san!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.090
Yeah, that sounds good!

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:21.180
Go, Heisuke! Show us a trick!

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:24.090
What?! I’ll leave that
stuff to you, Shinpatsu.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.900
You poop!

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:28.940
In that case, I,
Shinpachi Nagakura, will do my thing!

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:30.770
Yay! I’ve been waiting for this.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.920
First off, I’ll break these
chopsticks with my ass!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.500
Really, guys! That is nothin’!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.780
For my next trick, I’ll--!

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:49.840
It’s about time I headed
back to our headquarters.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.100
Have you had enough saké to drink?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.370
Yeah...

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.420
In that case, I’ll go back as well.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.400
Sounds good.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.000
Then I shall as well.

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.190
You can stay.

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:12.840
Take your time and enjoy the meal.

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:13.560
But...

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.890
Why not do as he said, Ryunosuke?

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:19.220
It’s rare to get a treat like
this, so clean your plates!

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:20.820
Right, right!

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:23.720
Serizawa-san even gave the a-okay.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:26.900
Nagakura-kun, I’ll
leave the rest to you.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.410
You got it!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.800
I believe I told you not
to come back here anymore.

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:49.170
This money...

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.190
I cannot accept it.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.530
You may have it back.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:55.390
I...

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.810
I want... to stay with you!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.570
I suspect that Hijikata

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.700
and the others are of a
mind to kill me tonight.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.740
You will get caught up
in this if you stay here.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:23.560
Leave while you still can.

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:27.460
I understand.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:32.970
That is all the more reason to
stay if you are going to die.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:36.720
Please let me die with you!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.460
I beg of you!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:43.230
You are all I have left now.

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.910
What a foolish woman.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.740
Toshi-san, his light went out.

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.330
Should we go?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.020
No, give him half an hour.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.500
Wait until he’s sound asleep.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.900
Thanks for the feast!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.270
It’s about time I headed on back.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:25.440
Well, Shinpatsu, why don’t
we call it a night ourselves?

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.950
We’re in charge of
patrol tomorrow morning.

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.160
Sounds good.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:31.530
You can’t.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.030
Huh?

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.780
I would like you to stay here.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.360
Does this mean...

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.260
something is about to go down?

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.920
Are you going to... kill Serizawa-san?!

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.050
What?!

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.430
Hajime-kun?

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.930
Kondou-san, what the
hell is this about?!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.640
Were you ordered to do this?!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.440
If such were the case,
what would you do?

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.850
Does everyone else know about this?

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:14.880
No, only a select few know.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.640
The commander decided that it would

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:19.070
be best if you did not bear witness.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.080
What the hell?! Don’t give me that!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.170
So you couldn’t tell me?!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.250
Hey! Wait a sec, Shinpatsu!

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:28.850
Ryunosuke!

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:32.710
Wait!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.360
Ryunosuke, you can’t go back!

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.730
Why the hell do you
have to kill that man?!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.230
Serizawa-san is--

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.390
Stop, Shinpachi!

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.860
You are the one man I cannot allow
to return to headquarters.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.430
Is it because I’m from the same
school as Serizawa-san?!

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.370
So you couldn’t trust me?!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.760
That isn’t it.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.290
In order to continue fighting along
your side as brothers-in-arms,

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.550
it is imperative that I
make sure you survive!

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:12.750
Shut up!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.050
You leave me no choice.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.180
Cut it out, you two!

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:25.140
Ryunosuke!

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:29.140
Heisuke, if you do not want
to let him die, stop him!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.190
Quit blowin’ me off!

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:41.290
Let’s go.

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:08.140
So you’ve finally come.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:10.350
Took long enough!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:32.090
If we’re brothers-in-arms,
why didn’t you tell me?

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:35.800
I’m prepared to fight along your side!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:39.720
Yet even so, I cannot let you go!

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.770
Damn it!

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.500
Why... did you flip your sword?

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.820
I believe I said that I was
fighting so that you may live.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:10.700
Goddamn it!

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.810
You’ve gone too far, Serizawa-san.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.100
For the sake of the Shinsengumi,

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:30.100
you must die.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.660
You think you can kill me?

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:36.110
What a hilarious joke!

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.380
This ain’t no joke!

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:42.610
I would never draw my
sword for show or in jest!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:47.120
For the Shinsengumi, I
will commit any crime...

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:51.120
I will even become a devil from Hell!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.260
Is that right?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.210
Do you think you
can become a true demon?

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.890
You dare make that claim?!

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:08.350
Harada!

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:18.540
Sano-san!

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:22.020
Heisuke?! What are you doing here?

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:25.360
Did Ryunosuke... come by here?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:26.860
What?!

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.620
Ibuki-kun?! You must not go in there!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.640
Inoue-san!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:34.500
Let go of me!

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:36.500
Serizawa-san!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.130
What?!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:38.340
Stop it! Please don’t do this!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:39.630
Ibuki-kun!
Stop it! Please don’t do this!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.300
Stop it! Please don’t do this!

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:42.880
Ibuki-kun!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.850
Why are you doing this?! Why?!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:47.930
Ryunosuke...

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.390
You damn idiot!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.930
Ibuki, why the hell did you come here?!

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:55.730
Please stop! I’m begging you!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.940
He’s fighting an illness!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.900
So what if he is?

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.340
Each of us...

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:05.990
...has reached the point where
there’s no going back!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.620
The stupid mongrel!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.500
You’re such a handful.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:18.750
The Water of Life?!

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:23.840
Wh-what the hell are you doing?!

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:31.390
This is going to be a real hassle now!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.770
Aren’t going to attack?

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:47.700
Then I will go ahead and
initiate the attack myself!

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.620
You can’t defeat me that easily!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:09.010
The idea of a wretch like
you saving my life...

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.880
...makes me sick with disgust!

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.350
Ryunosuke!

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:19.420
Harada!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:26.960
Why...?

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:30.400
Why did it have to come to this?

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:33.690
I can’t understand any of you at all!

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.240
Live, cur.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.250
If you fight with all
your might to live,

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.180
even you...

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:45.000
...will come to understand us one day.

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.800
You okay, Ryunosuke?

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:09.870
Ryunosuke!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.800
What’s keeping you, Hijikata?

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:16.210
Is this the best you’ve got?

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.580
Weren’t you going to surpass me?!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:22.950
You have a long ways to go

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:25.080
before you can become a true devil.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:27.340
Shut up!

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:31.090
It isn’t a matter of
whether I can or not.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.670
I WILL become one.

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:34.550
I’ve made my mind!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.120
This is for the best...

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.620
Well... done...

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:26.120
We have to search for
Ibuki-kun, don’t we?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.780
That means “Go kill
him,” doesn’t it?

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:58.380
I found you, Ibuki-kun.

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:02.860
Of all the people, I had
to be the one to find you.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.930
Tough luck, huh?

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.860
You always sucked at everything you did.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:15.940
You even stink at running away.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:31.840
A-are you going to kill me, too?

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.170
Huh?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.110
Didn’t you run away because you knew

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:36.340
that’s what I’d do?

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.860
I am going to live...!

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:58.110
I have to freaking live!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:02.370
You’ve changed, haven’t you?

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.120
So now you’ve finally developed
a true desire to live?

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:10.410
In that case,

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:12.610
why don’t you put some
faith in your luck?

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.380
Although, you don’t look
like you’ve got much luck.

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:24.680
Farewell, Ibuki-kun.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.630
I doubt I’ll ever see you again,

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.310
so this is where we say goodbye.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.200
I see...

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.290
True, we just got a
heavy downpour of rain.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.450
There’s no way he could have survived
getting swept away by the river.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:51.170
If Okita-kun and Hijikata-kun
both feel that way,

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.710
then we can leave it at that.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:54.620
Later!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.910
Hijikata-kun, you still have not fully

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.470
become a demon, have you?

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.350
I’m going to become

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.720
the devil commander starting now!

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.490
Regarding Niimi-san’s research.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:12.480
Henceforth I shall continue it in his stead.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:16.480
After all, the Bakufu ordered
us to experiment with it.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.080
Indeed...

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:21.570
We still have some men
who were turned into furies.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:25.370
Sannan-kun, please do
something to help them.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:30.550
Regarding that, I was
considering the idea

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:32.840
of giving them their own
squad in the Shinsengumi.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.090
Their own squad?

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:36.920
Yes. I thought we could
name them “Shinsengumi”

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.130
using the character “compiled”
instead of “selected.”

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:42.140
Very well. I’ll leave them to you.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.520
Mibu Temple of the
Enmei Jizo Bodhisattva

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:49.520
What gives, Sano?!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:51.900
Why didn’t you tell me?

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:54.020
You’re still going on
about that, Shinpachi?

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:57.810
Saito, you gotta let me whack you once!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:20:59.900
I refuse.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.390
Then I challenge you to a fight!

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:04.060
I wonder what happened to Ryunosuke...

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.950
With wooden swords!

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:08.780
His sturdy build was one
of his strong points.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.790
I’m sure he survived.

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:11.390
The Water of Life...

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:14.890
If we could turn this
into our strength...

00:22:19.110 --> 00:22:21.570
Take care of yourself
once you go back home.

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:23.670
Mother, I appreciate how you and

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:25.840
my elder sisters took
care of me for so long.

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:27.860
Well, I should go.

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:31.530
Oh, Chizuru-chan?

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:34.040
Where are you going dressed like that?

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:35.830
To the capital, Kyoto.

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.420
Kyoto? Are you going by yourself?

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:41.670
I am... I shall be away for a while.

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:43.320
You don’t say!

00:22:43.320 --> 00:22:46.060
Traveling on your own
can be dangerous, so be careful.

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:47.390
Thank you!

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:17.830
Live!

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:23.990
I am alive, Serizawa-san.

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:26.750
As long as I’m alive,

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:29.840
maybe someday I will grow to
understand how you felt...

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:33.140
Isn’t that right?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:40.670
The End
